      "post_date": "Sun Apr 20, 2014 7:54 am",
      "post_datetime": "2014-04-20T12:54:00+00:00",
      "post_subject": "Newell thesis",
      "content_md": "Thank you Steven.\n\nI haven't had a chance to look at this paper closely yet. But so far, it looks unusually good. The author has proper command of the English language, expresses himself clearly, and has a methodical approach. This can make all the difference. There were some comments about \"modulation\" which have helped clarify some important things for me. Not that those things haven't been said before, but they were said quite well.\n\nWho once said: \"what was oft thought, but ne'er so well expressed\" ?",
      "signature": "",
      "attachments": [],
      "quotes": [],
      "is_first_post": false,
      "url": "https://holographyforum.org/forum/viewtopic.php?p=7738#p7738"
    },
